{"id":"cracklib-check.8","n":"cracklib-check","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"cracklib","ver":"2.9.6-27.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/c/cracklib-2.9.6-27.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/cracklib-check.8.gz","sha256":"05abbfe7039c63fd1f3e9c216beec6edfda60568ee2f12e203f126dd2b618877","date":"Sat Jun 21 22:44:33 CEST 2008","origin":"Jan Dittberner"},"u":{"pkg":"cracklib-runtime","ver":"2.9.6-3.4build4","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/c/cracklib2/cracklib-runtime_2.9.6-3.4build4_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/cracklib-check.8.gz","sha256":"e720106c99a182de949afc18521c4025887d0e3d5751e034fae2bc16db9716d6","date":"Sat Jun 21 22:44:33 CEST 2008","origin":"Jan Dittberner"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"Check passwords using libcrack2","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>cracklib-check - Check passwords using libcrack2</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>cracklib-check</b></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>cracklib-check</b> takes a list of passwords from stdin and checks them via libcrack2's <b>FascistCheck</b>(3) sub routine.</p>"],["RESULT","<p><b>cracklib-check</b> prints each checked password and the corresponding result of <b>FascistCheck</b>(3) to stdout. The password and the result are separated by a colon.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>FascistCheck</b>(3)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>This man page was written by Jan Dittberner &lt;jandd@debian.org&gt; for the Debian GNU/Linux System (but may be used by others).</p>"]]}